  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International HIV/Aids Alliance 2011-2015 - International HIV/Aids Alliance 2011-15</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International HIV/Aids Alliance 2011-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Som en del av Barn- och umgdomssatsningen st&#xf6;djer Sida HIV/Aids Alliansen med ett st&#xf6;d i Syd Sudan med fokus p&#xe5; h&#xe4;lsa och utbildning  inom SRHR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project includes a scaling up project based on existing presence  of IHAA in South Sudan. It specifically targets young people  in      South Sudan and their right to access and receive youth friendly SRHR services. Focus is laid on prevention of HIV and other STDs as well   as a maternal health.</narrative>
  </description>
